title: The Right stops being one project

@pis_collapse
# scenario-ledger: PIS-06, PIS-07, PIS-08, PIS-09
# prose-audit: Grade A — The congress is caused by whichever PiS failure the player can already see, the claimants and the size of the contested caucus are fixed before any choice is offered, and Lewica decides only what it does about a rupture it has no authority to cause or prevent.
title: PiS holds the congress it has spent two years postponing
subtitle: Kaczyński's succession finally happens in a room he no longer controls; Lewica decides what the wreckage is for
face-image: img/poland/events/jaroslaw-kaczynski-2023.webp
new-page: true
tags: poland_event
priority: 31
order: 4
max-visits: 1
view-if: continuous_campaign = 1 and pis_collapsed = 0 and pis_collapse_pressure >= 68 and pis_seats >= 20 and snap_campaign_active = 0 and election_2027_terminal = 0
on-arrival: {!
const pisSeats = Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0));
const cohesion = Number(Q.united_right_cohesion) || 0;
// The cause is whichever failure the player actually produced, in the order a
// congress would report it: mandates that already left individually, a poll
// that no longer supports one list, a rival that has overtaken it on the same
// electorate, or a succession nobody could force while Kaczyński was alive to
// prevent it.
Q.pis_collapse_cause = Q.pis_split
    ? "rupture"
    : (Number(Q.pis_poll) || 0) < 26
        ? "polling"
        : (Number(Q.konf_poll) || 0) >= (Number(Q.pis_poll) || 0)
            ? "outbid"
            : "succession";
const taken = function(name) {
    return name == Q.president_name || name == Q.prime_minister;
};
const pick = function(names) {
    return names.find(function(name) { return !taken(name); }) ||
        "a collective presidium";
};
// Every claimant needs a live organisational record. A serving president or
// prime minister cannot also take the party chair; Nawrocki's presidential
// current therefore runs through its organiser when he holds the Palace.
const groups = Q.rival_group_records || [];
const group = function(id) {
    return groups.find(function(record) { return record.id == id; });
};
const organisation = function(id) {
    const record = group(id);
    return record && record.active ? Number(record.organisation || 0) : -100;
};
const solidaristShare = Number(Q.pis_solidarist_share) || 50;
const culturalPull = (Number(Q.cultural_issue_salience) || 30) -
    (Number(Q.economic_issue_salience) || 40);
const claimants = [
    {
        leader: "Mateusz Morawiecki",
        bloc: "the reconciled developmental current",
        score: organisation("morawiecki") +
            (Q.pis_morawiecki_reconciled ? 18 : -12)
    },
    {
        leader: "Mariusz Błaszczak",
        bloc: "an apparatus compact without a majority claimant",
        score: organisation("pis_apparatus") * 0.72 +
            organisation("pis_security") * 0.28 - 12
    },
    {
        leader: "Patryk Jaki",
        bloc: "the sovereigntist organisational network",
        score: organisation("solidarna") +
            (Q.suwerenna_walkout ? 10 : -15)
    },
    {
        leader: Q.president_name == "Karol Nawrocki"
            ? "Paweł Szefernaker" : "Karol Nawrocki",
        bloc: "Nawrocki's presidential current",
        score: organisation("pis_security") +
            (Q.pres_2025_winner == "Karol Nawrocki" ? 12 : -8)
    },
    {
        leader: "Beata Szydło",
        bloc: "the welfare-conservative current",
        score: organisation("pis_welfare") + (solidaristShare - 50) * 0.8
    },
    {
        leader: "Przemysław Czarnek",
        bloc: "the culture-war current",
        score: organisation("pis_culture") + culturalPull * 0.6
    }
].filter(function(claimant) { return !taken(claimant.leader); });
claimants.sort(function(left, right) { return right.score - left.score; });
const szydlo = claimants.find(function(item) { return item.leader == "Beata Szydło"; });
const czarnek = claimants.find(function(item) { return item.leader == "Przemysław Czarnek"; });
const dualLeadership = szydlo && czarnek &&
    Math.abs(szydlo.score - czarnek.score) <= 5 &&
    Math.max(szydlo.score, czarnek.score) >= (claimants[0] ? claimants[0].score - 3 : 0);
if (dualLeadership) {
    Q.pis_successor_leader = "Beata Szydło and Przemysław Czarnek";
    Q.pis_successor_bloc = "a dual welfare and culture-war leadership";
} else if (claimants[0] && claimants[0].score >= 64) {
    Q.pis_successor_leader = claimants[0].leader;
    Q.pis_successor_bloc = claimants[0].bloc;
} else {
    Q.pis_successor_leader = pick(["Mariusz Błaszczak", "Beata Szydło"]);
    Q.pis_successor_bloc = "an apparatus compact without a majority claimant";
}
Q.pis_congress_scores = claimants.map(function(item) {
    return item.leader + " " + Math.round(item.score);
}).join(" · ");
// The sovereigntist camp files first because it already has a registration,
// a justice network and a reason to distrust whoever wins.
Q.pis_sovereigntist_leader = pick(["Patryk Jaki", "Zbigniew Ziobro"]);
Q.pis_contested_caucus = Math.max(8, Math.min(
    Math.round(pisSeats * 0.55),
    Math.round(pisSeats * (0.22 + Math.max(0, 60 - cohesion) / 260))
));
Q.pis_collapse_stance = "Undecided";
Q.news_headline = "PiS opens the succession congress with three declared camps";
!}

= [+ date_label +] — The congress nobody could postpone again

[? if pis_collapse_cause = "rupture": The mandates went first. Every completed
departure to Rozwój+ was a deputy who discovered that leaving PiS is a
procedure rather than an impossibility, and the congress meets in a hall where
that is now common knowledge.?]
[? if pis_collapse_cause = "polling": PiS's own regional structures have done
the arithmetic. At this level of support one list returns fewer mandates than
the sum of what its camps believe they could win apart, and enough delegates
believe it to vote on it.?]
[? if pis_collapse_cause = "outbid": Konfederacja is now level with or ahead of
PiS among the voters PiS built its majority on. A party that exists to be the
only address for the Polish right has stopped being the only address, and the
congress is the first meeting where nobody pretends otherwise.?]
[? if pis_collapse_cause = "succession": The succession never happened while it
could be managed. **[+ pis_leader +]** could not be removed and could not be
replaced, and the question of what PiS is after him was answered by nobody for
long enough that it is now being answered by everybody at once.?]

Three camps arrive with delegate counts. **[+ pis_successor_leader +]** speaks
for [+ pis_successor_bloc +]. The others hold enough of the hall to deny any
winner the authority the office used to carry. Outside the room, **[+
pis_sovereigntist_leader +]**'s sovereigntist network has already told
journalists that it will not be bound by the result — it has its own
registration, its own prosecutors' network and its own list of grievances.

Roughly **[+ pis_contested_caucus +] MPs** sit in camps whose loyalty the
winner will have to earn rather than inherit.

[? if government_party = "pis": A cabinet resting on this caucus is resting on
a party that is deciding, this week, whether it is still one party.?]

Lewica cannot cause this and cannot stop it. It can decide what the break is
for: a parliamentary reckoning, a bid for the voters PiS is about to lose, a
refusal to let any camp start clean, or the structures nobody is defending.

- @pis_collapse_confidence
- @pis_collapse_material
- @pis_collapse_record
- @pis_collapse_ground

@pis_collapse_confidence
title: Force the chamber to recount the right's majority
subtitle: Put the arithmetic on the record while the camps are still arguing about who owns it; the constitutional route, not the electoral one.
on-arrival: pis_collapse_stance = "Force the arithmetic into the open"; pis_collapse_response = "Demand the chamber establish which clubs still exist"; constitutional_restraint += 3; public_trust += 2; media_capacity += 2; pis_relation -= 3; news_headline = "The Left asks the Sejm to establish which right-wing clubs still exist"

We do not comment on their congress. We ask the Marshal a procedural question
instead: which clubs currently exist, who chairs them, and on whose signatures.
The answer has to be given in writing and it cannot be given without naming the
split. The right loses the option of holding the congress in public and the
caucus in private, and every subsequent vote is counted against a register
somebody has now had to sign.

- @pis_collapse_result: Read the settlement

@pis_collapse_material
title: Bid for the voters the welfare camp is about to lose
subtitle: Go straight at PiS's small-town and pensioner electorate with wages, hospitals and transport while its own camps are fighting over who owns them.
on-arrival: pis_collapse_stance = "Bid for the welfare electorate"; pis_collapse_response = "Contest the welfare-conservative electorate directly"; labor_credibility += 3; household_security += 2; workers_support += 2; left_poll += 0.5; progressive_credibility -= 2; news_headline = "The Left campaigns for the electorate PiS built and is now dividing"

We spend the congress week somewhere else entirely: county hospitals, bus
routes that were cancelled, the pension question nobody in that hall is
answering. The offer is material and it is addressed to people who have voted
PiS for a decade because nobody else turned up. Our own members note that we
are courting an electorate that voted for the courts being broken, and they are
right, and we do it anyway.

- @pis_collapse_result: Read the settlement

@pis_collapse_record
title: Refuse every camp a clean beginning
subtitle: Hold all the successor camps to the one governing record they share; widens the break and hands part of it to Konfederacja.
on-arrival: pis_collapse_stance = "Put the record to every camp"; pis_collapse_response = "Deny every successor camp a clean beginning"; media_capacity += 3; public_trust += 1; konf_poll += 0.5; pis_relation -= 6; news_headline = "The Left puts one governing record to every PiS successor camp"

Every camp in that hall wants to be the part of PiS that was not responsible.
We publish the record with names against decisions: the Tribunal, the
prosecution service, the pandemic procurement, the Polish Deal. None of them
can campaign as an alternative to a government they sat in. The break widens,
because a camp that cannot claim innocence has less reason to stay. Part of
what breaks does not come to us: voters who wanted the record without the party
have somewhere louder to go.

- @pis_collapse_result: Read the settlement

@pis_collapse_ground
title: Take the structures nobody is defending
subtitle: No headlines, no procedural theatre; organisers, halls and county councillors while the camps fight over the name.
on-arrival: pis_collapse_stance = "Take the ground"; pis_collapse_response = "Organise where the right's structures have stopped functioning"; local_network += 4; party_system_left_pull += 2; media_capacity -= 1; news_headline = "The Left organises in the counties while the right argues about its name"

We say almost nothing. Our regional secretaries go instead to the places where
PiS's structure has just stopped answering the telephone: the county
councillors with no regional office, the cultural centres whose grants nobody
is now signing, the parish-adjacent networks that were never as loyal as they
looked. Nothing changes in the Sejm this month. In eighteen months there is a
Left presence where there used to be a PiS one.

- @pis_collapse_result: Read the settlement

@pis_collapse_result
title: The Right stops being one project
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
const group = function(id) {
    return (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
        return record.id == id;
    });
};
const pisSeats = Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.pis_seats) || 0));
const stance = Q.pis_collapse_stance;
const stanceScale = stance == "Take the ground"
    ? 0.92
    : stance == "Put the record to every camp" ? 1.12 : 1;
const contested = Math.max(0, Math.round(
    (Number(Q.pis_contested_caucus) || 0) * stanceScale
));
// The sovereigntists leave first and leave whole: they have a registration and
// a committee of their own, and a congress they lost is the reason they needed.
const sovereigntists = Math.max(0, Math.min(
    pisSeats - 10,
    Math.round(contested * 0.42)
));
// The developmental camp can only absorb people if it exists as something a
// deputy can join.
const rozwojCapacity = Q.rozwoj_party_formed
    ? 0.34
    : Q.rozwoj_club_formed ? 0.22 : 0;
const toRozwoj = Math.max(0, Math.min(
    pisSeats - 10 - sovereigntists,
    Math.round(contested * rozwojCapacity)
));
// Whoever will not sit under the new leader and will not join either vehicle
// sits alone. Nobody crosses to Lewica: this is not our electorate and a
// congress does not make it ours.
const independents = Math.max(0, Math.min(
    pisSeats - 10 - sovereigntists - toRozwoj,
    Math.round(contested * 0.12)
));
const departing = sovereigntists + toRozwoj + independents;
Q.pis_seats = Math.max(0, pisSeats - departing);
Q.pis_collapse_defectors = 0;
Q.pis_sovereigntist_seats = sovereigntists;
Q.pis_successor_seats = Q.pis_seats;
if (sovereigntists > 0) {
    Q.suwerenna_walkout = 1;
    Q.suwerenna_merged = 0;
    Q.suwerenna_own_list = 1;
    Q.suwerenna_seats =
        Math.max(0, Number(Q.suwerenna_seats) || 0) + sovereigntists;
    Q.suwerenna_merger_result = "Merger refused; separate committee filed";
}
if (toRozwoj > 0) {
    Q.rozwoj_seats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.rozwoj_seats) || 0) + toRozwoj;
    Q.pis_split = 1;
}
if (independents > 0) {
    Q.other_seats = Math.max(0, Number(Q.other_seats) || 0) + independents;
}
Q.pis_leader_previous = Q.pis_leader;
Q.pis_leader = Q.pis_successor_leader;
Q.pis_leader_changed = Q.pis_leader != Q.pis_leader_previous ? 1 : 0;
Q.pis_collapsed = 1;
Q.pis_collapse_time = Number(Q.time) || 0;
Q.united_right_cohesion = Math.min(
    Number(Q.united_right_cohesion) || 72,
    18
);
Q.pis_dominant_wing = Q.pis_successor_bloc;
Q.pis_ideology = Q.pis_successor_leader == "Beata Szydło"
    ? "Welfare-conservative · small-town · post-Kaczyński leadership"
    : Q.pis_successor_leader == "Przemysław Czarnek"
        ? "Culture-war national-conservative · clerical · post-Kaczyński leadership"
        : Q.pis_successor_leader == "Mariusz Błaszczak"
            ? "Security-conservative · apparatus continuity · post-Kaczyński leadership"
            : Q.pis_successor_leader == "Mateusz Morawiecki"
                ? "Developmental conservative · managerial · reconciled current"
                : Q.pis_successor_leader == "Patryk Jaki"
                    ? "Sovereigntist national-conservative · legal confrontation"
                    : Q.pis_successor_bloc == "Nawrocki's presidential current"
                        ? "Presidential national-conservative · security and memory politics"
                        : Q.pis_successor_bloc == "a dual welfare and culture-war leadership"
                            ? "Welfare-conservative · clerical · dual leadership"
                            : "Caretaker national-conservative · contested leadership";
Q.pis_welfare_destination = Q.pis_successor_leader == "Beata Szydło"
    ? "kept inside the party that kept the name"
    : "left without a natural home on the right";
Q.pis_poll = Math.max(6, (Number(Q.pis_poll) || 30) - 3.2);
Q.konf_poll = (Number(Q.konf_poll) || 0) +
    (stance == "Put the record to every camp" ? 1.1 : 0.6);
Q.pis_collapse_outcome = "PiS keeps the name under " + Q.pis_leader +
    " and stops being the only address on the Polish right";
Q.pis_collapse_result = departing + " MPs leave the party that won 2015" +
    (sovereigntists > 0
        ? "; " + sovereigntists + " file with " + Q.pis_sovereigntist_leader
        : "") +
    (toRozwoj > 0 ? "; " + toRozwoj + " join Rozwój+" : "") +
    (independents > 0 ? "; " + independents + " sit alone" : "");
const apparatus = group("pis_apparatus");
if (apparatus) {
    apparatus.leader = Q.pis_leader;
    apparatus.cohesion = 44;
    apparatus.legal_status = "party apparatus under a contested successor";
}
for (const id of ["pis_welfare", "pis_security", "pis_culture"]) {
    const current = group(id);
    if (!current) continue;
    current.cohesion = Math.max(0, (Number(current.cohesion) || 60) - 20);
    current.legal_status = "current inside a party that no longer arbitrates";
}
const solidarna = group("solidarna");
if (solidarna && sovereigntists > 0) {
    solidarna.active = 1;
    solidarna.independent = 1;
    solidarna.allied = 0;
    solidarna.leader = Q.pis_sovereigntist_leader;
    solidarna.club = "sp";
    solidarna.list_committee = "solidarna";
    solidarna.legal_status = "independent party with its own committee";
    solidarna.exclusive_seats = Q.suwerenna_seats;
    solidarna.sejm_mps = Q.suwerenna_seats;
    solidarna.mp_count = Q.suwerenna_seats;
}
const rozwoj = group("rozwoj_plus");
if (rozwoj && toRozwoj > 0) {
    rozwoj.exclusive_seats =
        Math.max(0, Number(rozwoj.exclusive_seats) || 0) + toRozwoj;
    rozwoj.mp_count = rozwoj.exclusive_seats;
    rozwoj.sejm_mps = rozwoj.exclusive_seats;
}
// A cabinet resting on PiS's caucus loses those votes on the day they leave.
Q.pis_collapse_government_shock = 0;
if (
    Q.government_party == "pis" &&
    Q.government_has_confidence && !Q.caretaker_government
) {
    Q.government_support_seats = Math.max(
        0,
        (Number(Q.government_support_seats) || 0) - departing
    );
    Q.government_coalition_dissent =
        (Number(Q.government_coalition_dissent) || 0) + 10;
    Q.early_election_risk = Math.max(Number(Q.early_election_risk) || 0, 64);
    Q.pis_collapse_government_shock = 1;
}
Q.news_headline = "PiS splits: " + Q.pis_collapse_result;
!}

= [+ pis_collapse_result +]

**[+ pis_leader +]** wins a party that is no longer the thing it was won for.
PiS keeps the name, the registration, the debts and **[+ pis_seats +]
mandates**; what it does not keep is the claim that there is one address for
the Polish right and this is it. That claim was the project, and it ended in
the hall rather than at an election.

[? if pis_sovereigntist_seats > 0: **[+ pis_sovereigntist_leader +]** files a
separate committee for the sovereigntist camp with **[+
pis_sovereigntist_seats +] MPs** — the prosecutors' network, the justice
files and the argument that PiS lost because it was not hard enough.?]
[? if pis_split and rozwoj_club_formed: The developmental camp takes the
deputies who wanted a modern conservative party and could never get one from
Kaczyński.?]
[? if pis_leader_changed: **[+ pis_leader_previous +]** does not preside over
what follows. There was never a mechanism for removing him and there did not
have to be: the party simply stopped being the thing his authority governed.?]

[? if pis_welfare_destination = "left without a natural home on the right":
The welfare-conservative electorate — pensioners, small towns, the transfer
voters PiS built the 2015 majority on — has been left without anybody on the
right whose first sentence is about money. That is an opening and it is not
automatically ours.?]

[? if pis_collapse_stance = "Force the arithmetic into the open": The register
now exists in writing. Every confidence, budget and procedural vote from here
is counted against clubs somebody had to sign for, which is a smaller victory
than a collapse and a more durable one.?]
[? if pis_collapse_stance = "Bid for the welfare electorate": We spent the week
on wages, hospitals and buses in counties that have voted against us for ten
years. Nothing has been won yet. Something has been started that only exists
because we were there in the week the other side was not.?]
[? if pis_collapse_stance = "Put the record to every camp": No successor camp
gets to campaign as the alternative to a government it sat in. The break is
wider for it, and Konfederacja — which really was not in that cabinet — has
been handed the one position we could not occupy.?]
[? if pis_collapse_stance = "Take the ground": No mandate moved because of
anything we did. The organisational vacuum in the counties is ours to fill, on
a timescale measured in elections rather than months.?]

[? if pis_collapse_government_shock: The cabinet has lost those votes. Its
majority now depends on whoever can be assembled from a chamber that has just
watched the governing party stop being one party.?]

- @pis_collapse_finish

@pis_collapse_finish
title: Return the succession to the leadership table
go-to: poland_event_queue
